		{
			"identifier": "fall_out_margin",
			"doc": "How far past this room's bounds, ALONG the fall direction, a body may drift before the world declares it gone. A platformer's pit depth and a platform fighter's blast zone are the same number, which is why the field is named for the axis and not for either genre. Unset takes the engine default (200px).",
